[NDBG.12.3.1] `ds/setFactBreakpoints` registers breakpoints that fire
on fact lifecycle events rather than rule fires.

Request:
```json
{
  "breakpoints": [
    {
      "schema": "Sensor",
      "on": ["assert", "retract"],
      "where": "sensor.value > 90.0",
      "hitCondition": ""
    }
  ]
}
```
